00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:35.680
in its appeal that the errors in question were only minor ones. The ongoing case may influence

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:42.060
the approach's company's take toward managing AI answers. Millions of people view these AI answers

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:48.040
each day. The outcome could affect how search providers address mistakes in automated summaries

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:55.720
going forward. Details on the ruling appeared in coverage from the-decoder.com. A man living with

00:04:55.720 --> 00:05:02.260
ALS has used a brain implant for nearly three years. He controls a computer entirely through his thoughts

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:08.220
during that period. Researchers have described him as their first power user of the technology.

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:14.820
The implant allows direct thought-based interaction without physical movement. Progress in the field

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:21.040
is occurring rapidly enough to expand access. Additional individuals with paralysis could receive

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:27.440
comparable implants in the near term. The update came from reporting at technologyreview.com.

